        "Eating more than we need. Many people only count the first as waste, but the Sharīʿah counts the second too. || Keragidan ortiq yeyish. Ko‘pchilik faqat birinchisini isrof deb biladi, lekin shariat ikkinchisini ham isrof sanaydi.",
