        "For ʿAlī and Fāṭimah, the Prophet ﷺ told ʿAlī a feast was needed; Saʿd gave a ram and some of the Anṣār brought a few measures of corn (reported by Ahmad). || Ali va Fotima to‘yida Payg‘ambar ﷺ Aliga to‘y qilish kerakligini aytdilar; Sa’d bir qo‘chqor berdi, ansoriylar bir necha so‘ jo‘xori keltirishdi (Ahmad rivoyati).",
