        "The Ummah and the majority of scholars agree on this. || Ummat va ulamolar jumhuri bunga ijmo qilgan.",
        "The new family carries the groom’s name, and the bride leaving her home to join it is an honour for the groom’s family, so they hold the feast in her honour. || Yangi oila kuyovning nomidagi oila, kelinning o‘z uyini tashlab kelishi kuyov oilasi uchun sharaf, shuning uchun ular uning sharafiga to‘y beradi.",
